  "description": "REKKOI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H84 Lu4 O4 Si4. From the CIF bond table, Lu1 (Lu) has 3 O neighbors; Lu2 (Lu) has 3 O neighbors; Lu3 (Lu) has 3 O neighbors; Lu4 (Lu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.197-3.216 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.08-97.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(C5Me4SiMe3)Lu(μ3-O)]4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
